<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0060_D18R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ..................\r......Oh, it’s you.\rYou here to catch the legendary homie\nso you look hard?\rThat’s a pipe dream.\rThe legendary homie belong to somebody\nlike me who swore to be the strongest.\rScrappin’ Fed Agents is more your\nspeed. Go write a parkin’ ticket.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0060_D18R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Aw, whatever.\rYou could never catch a\nlegendary homie anyway.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0060_D18R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eusine: My name is Eusine. I’m on the\ntrail of SUICUNE.\rAnd you...? {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? Charmed. Don’t\ntouch my cape.\rI heard SUICUNE was here, so I came. I\nfollow it EVERYWHERE.\rIt’s down in the basement right now. I\ncould go down there...\rBut it run off every time. I tried\nfifty times. I got a restrainin’ order.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0060_D18R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eusine: There’s more to you than meet\nthe eye... SUICUNE noticed. I’m\fjealous.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0060_D18R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: My name is Morty. Ecruteak’s\nBlock Boss. I see ghosts.\fProfessionally.\rMy old homie Eusine chasin’ SUICUNE, so\nI came to keep him outta trouble.\rEcruteak got a legend: SUICUNE,\nENTEI, and RAIKOU.\rAs Block Boss, I gotta understand it.\nAlso Eusine owe me bread.</language>
	</row>
</body>
